   "type": "text",
   "textRegions": [
    {
     "characters": "Frank Ocean is more than just a singer \u2014 he\u2019s a storyteller. Starting his career as a songwriter for stars like Beyonc\u00e9 and John Legend, he found his own voice with his mixtape Nostalgia, Ultra (2011) and breakthrough album Channel Orange (2012). His most iconic work, Blonde (2016), changed the sound of modern R&B forever.",
