   "opacity": 1,
   "isLocked": false,
   "type": "text",
   "textRegions": [
    {
     "characters": "Through his music, Frank Ocean shares messages of love, identity, vulnerability, and self-discovery. He isn\u2019t afraid to explore feelings of heartbreak, loneliness, or hope, often writing with raw honesty that makes listeners feel understood. His sound blends R&B, soul, and dreamy melodies, creating a world where emotions take center stage.\nFrank Ocean\u2019s message is simple but powerful: be true to yourself, embrace your feelings, and don\u2019t be afraid of vulnerability.\n",
